SF0077 Compelled speech is not free speech.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Hutchings, Boner, Ide, Smith, D and
Steinmetz and Representative(s) Andrew, Banks, Bear,
Haroldson, Neiman and Smith, S
AN ACT relating to the administration of government; prohibiting the state and
its political subdivisions from requiring the use of preferred pronouns;
authorizing a civil remedy; and providing for an effective date.
